OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in 80s dies following house
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 80s has died after
OL,7,Fsuffering serious burns in a house fire
OL,8,Fin Bradford.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,11,Fproperty on Woodlands Street shortly
OL,12,Fbefore 13:15 BST on Sunday, West
OL,13,FYorkshire Police said.
OL,15,FThe injured woman was taken to
OL,16,Fhospital, where she later died.
OL,18,FOfficers said the fire was not being
OL,19,Ftreated as suspicious.
